  "solution": "#include \"Rover.h\"\n\nvoid setup() {\n}\n\n// Keep the wall on the right: try right first, then straight, then left.\nvoid loop() {\n  turnRight();\n  while (distanceAhead() == 0) {\n    turnLeft();\n  }\n  forward(1);\n}\n"
